            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_aa17feb1">
               <titlePage label="" xml:id="titlePage_e0e38e38">
                  <p xml:id="idm36">Joh. Seb. Bach's / Passionsmusik / nach dem Evangelisten Matthäus / mit ausgeführtem Accompagnement / bearbeitet / von / Robert Franz. / Partitur. / Arrangement Eigenthum der Verleger. / Leipzig, Breitkopf &amp; Härtel. / Eingetragen in das Vereinsarchiv. / 10978. / Partitur Pr. 12 Thlr. 36 Mk. netto - Orchesterstimmen Pr. 15 Thlr. 45 Mk.  netto. Chorstimmen P. 2 Thlr. 6 Mk. netto.</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_4171d04a"/>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_cc0f5db8"/>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_9df5cc87">Quarter bound with marbled sides and leather spine. In lower left-hand corner a label inscribed: "Musikforeningens Archiv. / Partitur. / Bach, J.S. / Passionsmusik nach Matthæus / (bearb. af Rob. Franz) / 888)". On the flyleaf Emil Erslev has written:<lb xml:id="idm40"/>T betegner: Theater  M betegner: Musikforening<lb xml:id="idm41"/>Alt hvad der vedkommer Theatrets Dirigent er betegnet med Blaakridt.<lb xml:id="idm42"/>Alt hvad der angaaer Musikforeningen er betegnet med Rødkridt.<lb xml:id="idm43"/> </physMedium>
               <plateNum xml:id="plateNum_38b16df5">10978</plateNum>
            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_d48e0caa">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_ae701b31">
                  <p xml:id="idm47">Two copies of this edition with Gade's cuts and changes for the performances of Bachs "Passion according to Saint Matthew" in Musikforeningen in Copenhagen on Maundy Thursday and Good Friday 1875. One copy was meant for the Gade himself, conducting Musikforeningens Orkester (Orchestra of The Music Society) and the other one for the conductor of The Royal Orchestra. Gade's reduced the 78 numbers in this edition to 35 and adapted the recitatives for the Danish translation of the text, which has been glued into the score.</p>
               </annot>
               <annot type="links" xml:id="annot_e5fd2ca8">
                  <ptr label="" mimetype="" xml:id="ptr_6573b8f8"/>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
